  "prefLabel": "Ed 1114.22 Protections Afforded to Children With Disabilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1114.22 Protections Afforded to Children With Disabilities. A child placed by an LEA in an approved private provider of special education or other non-LEA program shall be afforded all the rights of a child with a disability who is served by a public agency as provided in 34 CFR 300.146.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
